OL,3,GNEWSA'Lifeline' for women from minority
OL,4,Afaith groups
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Lancashire community project helping
OL,7,Fwomen and girls feel safer in parks is
OL,8,Fa "brilliant, safe environment",
OL,9,Fparticipants say.
OL,11,FThe SAS Rights She Connects Safer Parks
OL,12,FProject is a 14-week programme which
OL,13,Faims to support women and girls from
OL,14,Fminority faith communities through
OL,15,Factivities, wellbeing sessions and
OL,16,Fworkshops.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
