OL,3,GNEWSA'Lifeline' for women from minority
OL,4,Afaith groups
OL,5,
OL,6,FLancashire Police and Crime
OL,7,FCommissioner Clive Grunshaw awarded the
OL,8,FBlackburn project #5,000 through the
OL,9,FCommissioner's Community Fund, which
OL,10,Fputs money seized from criminals back
OL,11,Finto the community.
OL,13,FDirector Saima Afzal MBE said: "We just
OL,14,Fwant to be able to meet people, break
OL,15,Fdown barriers, use a public space, and
OL,16,Ffeel safe in that space."
